BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 317.77 Tm (The fastest way to lose an IDR claim is the calendar. The PYA panel warned that missing a deadline 'by a day or two') Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 302.55 Tm (can invalidate the entire IDR, and told providers to run trackers [j1DGgPw1__E @ 00:26:37]. Rachel V. Rose mapped) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 287.32 Tm (the clock: 30 business days of open negotiation, then 4 business days to initiate, roughly day 34, through the CMS) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 272.10 Tm (federal IDR portal; each side then has 10 business days to submit an offer as a dollar amount and as a percentage of) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 256.87 Tm (QPA, and the decision lands within 30 business days [uQSw1Ucy6L4 @ 01:02:22]. The cash-flow drag compounds.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 241.65 Tm (PYA flagged a 90-day cooling-off period that stretches the process to 140+ days, told operators to expect 90 to 120) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 226.42 Tm (days to a first decision, and reported 46,000 disputes filed with 3 of 11 IDR entities near closure. Kim Stenger of) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 211.20 Tm (Holland & Hart noted plans must pay or deny within 30 days of a clean claim [aaDjROGKKC0 @ 00:06:29], but Rich) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 195.97 Tm (Heller of Radiology Partners reported insurers delay out-of-network payment to earn interest [q1qFNKqrEcs @) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 180.75 Tm (00:06:09]. Rose's checklist closes the loop: update policies, procedures and IDR timelines, and coordinate with EHR) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 165.52 Tm (vendors and clearinghouses before the first dispute.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 150.30 Tm (Baseball arbitration punishes greedy offers. Jentry Harris laid out the 'winner takes all' mechanic: the arbitrator weighs) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 135.07 Tm (QPA, market data, complexity, contracted rates, and training and experience, then picks one offer, not the average) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 119.85 Tm ([LNSPlo2_U3c @ 00:01:29]. The Arizona self-funded case Harris walked through shows the provider downside: an) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 104.62 Tm (anesthesiology group billed $42,000 against a QPA of roughly $18,000, IDR sided with the plan at just over $21,000,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 89.40 Tm (and the plan saved about $20,000. Dr. Neil Baum of Grand Rounds in Urology added the second sting: 'the losing party) Tj ET
