0.6 w 54.00 747.00 m 558.00 747.00 l S
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 716.00 Tm (Kind: OPERATOR GATE) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 700.77 Tm (Title: Four Checks Before Filing IDR or Sending a Patient Bill) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 685.55 Tm (Body: Each check maps to a loss, reversal, or bottleneck the practitioners reported firsthand.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 670.32 Tm (Items: Load every open-negotiation, initiation, and offer deadline into a tracker before the first dispute, because) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 655.10 Tm (missing one by a day or two can invalidate the IDR [PYA, PC - j1DGgPw1__E @ 00:26:37].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 639.87 Tm (Never rely on notice-and-consent for emergency medicine, anesthesiology, pathology, radiology, neonatology,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 624.65 Tm (hospitalists, diagnostics, or air ambulance, because those can never be waived [CMSHHSgov - aQ87InetyaA @) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 609.42 Tm (00:27:28].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 594.20 Tm (Price every final offer against winner-takes-all selection, since the arbitrator picks one offer and not the average [Jentry) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 578.97 Tm (Harris - LNSPlo2_U3c @ 00:01:29].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 563.75 Tm (Keep a copy of every notice-and-consent document for 7 years and expect consent to be very difficult to obtain) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 548.52 Tm ([Holland & Hart LLP - aaDjROGKKC0 @ 00:39:06].) Tj ET
BT /F0 17 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 526.30 Tm (Pull Quote) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 494.65 Tm (Benchmarking at the median in-network rate is a powerful way to take the top 50% of rates, cut them off, throw them) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 479.42 Tm (away and recalibrate everything downward. - Radiology Partners \(q1qFNKqrEcs @ 00:06:58\).) Tj ET
BT /F0 17 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 457.20 Tm (Revision) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 425.55 Tm (66d7e44c5b900bfc) Tj ET
BT /F0 17 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 403.32 Tm (Operator checklist) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 371.67 Tm ([ ] Bill the plan directly first to find out whether No Surprises Act protections apply to the claim [CMSHHSgov -) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 356.45 Tm (aQ87InetyaA @ 00:12:04].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 334.22 Tm ([ ] Use CMS Form 10780 for notice and consent, deliver it at least 72 hours before the appointment or with at least 3) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 319.00 Tm (hours' notice same day, and keep it separate from other forms [CMSHHSgov - aQ87InetyaA @ 00:35:01].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 296.77 Tm ([ ] Build an IDR calendar: 30 business days of open negotiation, 4 business days to initiate through the CMS federal) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 281.55 Tm (IDR portal, and 10 business days to submit an offer as a dollar amount and a percentage of QPA [First Healthcare) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 266.32 Tm (Compliance - uQSw1Ucy6L4 @ 01:02:22].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 244.10 Tm ([ ] Assemble prior in-network rates from the past 4 years as IDR evidence and challenge any down-coding [PYA, PC -) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 228.87 Tm (j1DGgPw1__E @ 00:30:31].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 206.65 Tm ([ ] Pursue a secured in-network deal as the alternative to IDR and avoid short termination clauses [PYA, PC -) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 191.42 Tm (j1DGgPw1__E @ 00:50:52].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 169.20 Tm ([ ] If running a self-funded plan, put a capable TPA or adviser on QPA and IDR handling or you will overpay without) Tj ET
