BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 556.75 Tm (anesthesia consultation when only local numbing happened, wrong dates, and units that do not match documentation,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 541.52 Tm (such as 10 units of something given once [ofqIwNzp8lA @ 00:03:13]. Bill Fighter supplies the exact request language) Tj ET
