BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 328.37 Tm (days from the denial to file in most cases [HwCCcS3hQls @ 00:02:12]. The Patient Blueprint shows the math to quote) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 313.15 Tm (on the call: a $3,500 anesthesia charge against a $1,800 in-network allowed amount leaves 20% coinsurance of $360,) Tj ET
