BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 716.00 Tm (only works if it starts before that deadline because the clock is already running [HwCCcS3hQls @ 00:02:12]. Problem) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 700.77 Tm (Solved Lab extends the acceptance trap to installments: dispute before you pay, before you set up a payment plan, and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 685.55 Tm (before you put the bill on a credit card, because a payment plan can be read as acceptance of the full amount) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 670.32 Tm ([ofqIwNzp8lA @ 00:03:46]. For uninsured and self-pay patients, Law Unpacked flags the single document whose) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 655.10 Tm (absence kills the $400 dispute path: keep the written good faith estimate, because without it you cannot dispute, and the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 639.87 Tm (window is 120 days from the first bill at a $25 fee [0NouMpFWLHI @ 00:02:51]. Even a won negotiation can unravel.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 624.65 Tm (Bill Fighter insists on written settlement language such as payment in full satisfies the account before paying one) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 609.42 Tm (penny, usually by email, because without that paper trail they could come back 6 months later and bill you for the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 594.20 Tm (remainder [OWN7CBskcIQ @ 00:07:51]. The common failure across all four is acting on the bill before building the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 578.97 Tm (record, and the record is what wins the dispute.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 563.75 Tm (The third failure layer is structural: loopholes and counterparties that outlast the patient. FOX 26 Houston's Cristina) Tj ET
