BT /F2 8 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 755.00 Tm (THE BIG MONEY PLAYBOOKS) Tj ET
0.6 w 54.00 747.00 m 558.00 747.00 l S
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 716.00 Tm (logging in. Culver also notes that claims ready before April 15 had to be filed by May 6 [6_ODgJ97UtA @ 00:24:00].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 700.77 Tm (The same panel warns that parties stalling while they work through a state regulator can miss the federal deadlines) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 685.55 Tm (entirely, because the four-day initiation window keeps running. Miller Johnson's Michigan team describes the state-side) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 670.32 Tm (version. A claim submitted after 60 days leaves the provider stuck, with no ability to balance bill [EwlPyAVGU8k @) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 655.10 Tm (00:46:02]. Once a dispute reaches arbitration, the team says, you are not supposed to be adding additional information,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 639.87 Tm (so you want to do it right the first time when arguing with the plan [EwlPyAVGU8k @ 00:27:15]. New Hampshire) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 624.65 Tm (adds a cash trap: a party that fails to submit its half of the IDR entity fee by day 10 has a default judgment entered) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 609.42 Tm (against it [C6hIoQuEWeA @ 00:12:38]. Each of these losses is procedural. The record built during open negotiation is) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 594.20 Tm (the record that decides the dispute, and a missed fee, a stale claim, or a late portal filing can end the fight before value) Tj ET
