BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 685.55 Tm (Detail: The initiating party must download the PDF and send a copy to the non-initiating party on the same day the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 670.32 Tm (form is submitted, and both sides then receive portal confirmation emails [CMSHHSgov - cw4MI_h6Gns @ 00:15:54]) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 648.10 Tm (The execution clock runs in fixed blocks. The open negotiation notice must carry dates of service, service codes, the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 632.87 Tm (initial payment or denial notice, an out-of-network rate offer, and sender contact details. Brander relays a payer-side) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 617.65 Tm (complaint that the form cannot identify the customer. Providers solve it by adding their own fields or attaching an) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 602.42 Tm (EOB; otherwise the payer reaches back for information [7lzQt8aAlG0 @ 00:09:52]. Cartabiano anchors that offer to) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 587.20 Tm (the in-network commercial equivalent. Audits of client organizations find a 50/50 split. The half paid around 15 to 17) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 571.97 Tm (percent of billed charges, against a QPA typically couched at roughly 100 to 115 percent of Medicare, is the population) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 556.75 Tm (targeted toward 45, 50, or 55 percent of charges [7lqb5ev54mA @ 00:03:38]. When the 30 business days expire) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 541.52 Tm (without a deal, the CMS web form demo allows four business days to initiate [cw4MI_h6Gns @ 00:00:05]. Staffingly) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 526.30 Tm (calls that window absolute: a miss forfeits the claim entirely [ASHyX7v13Eo @ 00:02:49]. Cartabiano explains why) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 511.07 Tm (four days hurts. The arbitration package is far heavier than the single negotiation letter, and fresh claims keep rolling) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 495.85 Tm (off their own negotiation periods while the team builds it. Without structure, the workload compounds fast.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 480.62 Tm (Inside the Notice of IDR Initiation web form, the traps are mechanical. The demo warns the form must be completed in) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 465.40 Tm (one session and times out after 60 minutes of inactivity. An open negotiation start date more than 34 business days) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 450.17 Tm (back triggers an extension-justification prompt, and at least one upload proving that start date is mandatory) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 434.95 Tm ([cw4MI_h6Gns @ 00:04:22]. Each line item needs a claim number, date of service, QPA, a claim-and-QPA document,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 419.72 Tm (cost sharing, service code, up to four two-character modifiers, and place of service. The portal blocks any duplicate) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 404.50 Tm (combination of claim number, date, code, and modifier unless a cooling-off closure or approved extension applies) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 389.27 Tm ([cw4MI_h6Gns @ 00:11:17]. CMS's Matt Meidell fixes the offer math. The offer is the full amount requested,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 374.05 Tm (including what was already paid, expressed both as a dollar figure and as a percentage of the QPA. The QPA entered) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 358.82 Tm (should match the initial payment or denial notice [7lzQt8aAlG0 @ 00:20:34]. Lido's Andres flags the newest) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 343.60 Tm (bottleneck: the centralized IDR gateway no longer offers an API. Filers either key data manually or use a vendor that) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 328.37 Tm (automates entry without one, which Lido claims to have caught ahead of the market [NHWPEtUOyK0 @ 00:06:21].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 313.15 Tm (Batching is where fee savings and rejections collide. Meidell lists the four batching tests: same provider, group, or) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 297.92 Tm (facility; same plan or issuer; same or similar service code; and all items furnished within the same 30 business day) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 282.70 Tm (period [7lzQt8aAlG0 @ 00:23:43]. Staffingly confirms CMS allows grouping to save fees but says improperly grouped) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 267.47 Tm (claims are immediately rejected [ASHyX7v13Eo @ 00:02:33]. The evidence package is the other heavy lift.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 252.25 Tm (Cartabiano's three core elements are a demographic case positioning the organization as one that commands premium) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 237.02 Tm (in-network rates, a clinical complexity review pulled from the medical record, and a financial comparison. That) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 221.80 Tm (comparison lines up the in-network commercial rate, amount paid, Medicare, and Medicaid for that service and region,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 206.57 Tm (with specifics rather than broad strokes [7lqb5ev54mA @ 00:05:47]. Cartabiano sharpens the package by meeting IDR) Tj ET
