BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 716.00 Tm (inside the appeal [5aFK91a1KPY @ 00:51:05]. Thomas J. Force of Patriot Group sits in between. Force keeps written) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 700.77 Tm (appeals to two pages because carriers have short attention spans, ships them by fax or certified mail, and expects a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 685.55 Tm (response within 60 days [dUdxVBDLf5w @ 00:13:15]. The AR Specialist breakdown shows why no single channel) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 670.32 Tm (wins. Quantum Health takes fax or mail at Dublin, Ohio, while UMR accepts no faxes at all, only its portal or mail to) Tj ET
