BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 624.65 Tm (proof of receipt and a tracked response window.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 609.42 Tm (Practitioners also split on whether to quote recovery numbers at all. Collect Rx's Ryan Ellison puts the prepayment) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 594.20 Tm (negotiation average at 90 to 100 percent of billed charges. Ellison backs it with a client who moved from an 80 percent) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 578.97 Tm (average to 94.1 percent on $1.5 million, netting more than $135,000 after fees [Pqx2hpp_cLU @ 00:12:07]. Talisman) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 563.75 Tm (Solutions refuses that pitch outright, telling auditors to avoid promising a recovery rate before reviewing the portfolio.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 548.52 Tm (Talisman measures value first by clear root causes and speed to action, and only then by eventual recovery) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 533.30 Tm ([Zf9f4f3lmAw @ 00:01:11]. The pricing anchor is contested too. Force treats Medicare as the floor, not the ceiling, and) Tj ET
